## Types DB

Régénérer si drift :
```bash
supabase gen types typescript --project-id cxjpburiiazzvlczzupy \
  --schema public > packages/database/src/types/index.ts
```

## Workflow migrations SQL (OBLIGATOIRE)

1. Écrire SQL dans `supabase/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_<nom>.sql`
2. `supabase db query --linked --file supabase/migrations/<fichier>.sql`
3. Valider : `supabase db query --linked "SELECT tablename FROM pg_tables WHERE schemaname='public'"`
4. Commit + push
